      "note": "Yunus, Hud, Yusuf, Ibrahim and Al-Hijr open with Alif-Lām-Rā (Ar-Raʿd with Alif-Lām-Mīm-Rā). At-Tirmidhi (Abu Bakr): 'O Messenger of Allah, you have gone grey!' — 'Hud and its sisters made me grey: Al-Waqiʿah, Al-Mursalat, ʿAmma yatasāʾalūn and Idha sh-shamsu kuwwirat.' Commentators (al-Qurtubi) report Ibn 'Abbas saying no verse was harder on the Prophet than fa-staqim kamā umirta (112)."
